{"ID":"20240118145008-htn5rnp","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145008-htn5rnp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145008-htn5rnp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145008-r3wn35a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240204151233-1txfog9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162939-ej32xcm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:207,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:207\u0026#125;","title":"342贝子","type":"doc","updated":"20240903102503"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145008-r3wn35a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145008-r3wn35a","updated":"20240122162916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，平，有毒。治目翳，鬼疰，腹痛，下血，五癃，利水道。生东海池泽。一名贝齿。又名大贝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162920-bgj9cem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162920-bgj9cem"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产海滨，壳略似三角形，口作锯齿状，有白色紫色之花者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162924-nnpg74m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162924-nnpg74m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性平，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162925-l6tgpel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162925-l6tgpel"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】贝齿主散结热，利水道，治目翳，狂热，鬼疰蛊毒，搜湿毒，通五癃。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162927-p8tpt5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162927-p8tpt5w"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】温病寒热，解肌，散结热。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162929-5y6ugna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162929-5y6ugna"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】伤寒狂热。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162930-zh71y4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162930-zh71y4b","updated":"20240122162935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【弘景】烧研点目去翳。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162931-1bip72d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162931-1bip72d"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【李珣】下水气浮肿，小儿疳蚀，吐乳。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162937-w7x2xfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162937-w7x2xfr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162938-9nsc7xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162938-9nsc7xs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】蜜醋浸透，虾米酒淘入药，无湿热结滞者勿用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162918-4fghquy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162918-4fghquy"}},{"ID":"20240122162939-lp59clm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162939-lp59clm"}},{"ID":"20240122162939-ej32xcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162939-ej32xcm","updated":"20240204151330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"342，贝子，就是海边一种贝壳，产在海边，壳成锯齿状，这个贝壳是这样子的（展示样本）。一般来说圆的这是蛤蜊，那贝子呢不是这样子的，（有点像锯齿状），它下面另外一片长成这样子，刚好跟它是对着的，这就是贝子，蛤蜊呢口是圆的，这是圆形蛤蜊。一般来说在海边的不管是海蛤、贝子，这些东西呢，味道都是咸的，你看主治：能够散结热，利水道。一般来说，我们用到甲壳类的东西，大部分都是使用在淋巴结，淋巴肿瘤病患上面，才会使用它。那这种药也可以点眼睛，你看它点眼睛去眼疾的。"}]},{"ID":"20240204151233-1txfog9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204151233-1txfog9","updated":"20240903102503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240204151233-ku72ogz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}